    <briefdescription>
<para>Context of a single client connection. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Interaction scheme:</para><para>Receive from the network. | +<mdash/>|------------------<mdash/>+ +---------<mdash/>+ | | iproto thread | | tx thread | | v | | | | ibuf[0]- - - - - - - - -|- -|- - &gt;+ | | | | | | | ibuf[1] | | | | | | | | | | obuf[0] &lt;- - - - - - - -|- -|- - -+ | | | | | | | | | obuf[1] &lt;- - -|- -|- - -+ | +-<mdash/>|--------<mdash/>|-----<mdash/>+ +---------<mdash/>+ | v | Send to | network. v Send to network after obuf[1], i.e. older responses are sent first.</para><para>ibuf structure: rpos wpos end +----------------<mdash/>|-------------<mdash/>|----------<mdash/>+ ________/________/ ________/____/ \ msg msg / msg parse ______________/ size response is sent, messages are discarded </para>    </detaileddescription>
